  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard covers **Piraeus LVM thin-pool and volume accounting**. Thin-pool used, capacity, and free bytes are physical pool measurements. Diskful PV limits are a separate commitment measure; their ratio to raw capacity is not physical-use percentage and can exceed 100%. Per-copy allocation estimates do not decompose physical pool use.\n\nThe PVC table shows kubelet-reported filesystem use on the consumer node alongside a Bound PV capacity limit. It is separate from both host ext4/XFS filesystem accounting and thin-pool physical use. Raw-block or unmounted PVCs may have no filesystem-use sample.\n\nThe Storage tier selector filters by node labels; Machine filters node-owned panels. This is node-level filtering. If a node later has both SSD and HDD, per-device media labels will be needed to separate those disks."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Piraeus thin pools",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "title": "Physical pool used",
      "description": "Piraeus thin-pool physical use, summed over the selected storage nodes and pools.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(disk_usage:pool_used_bytes{node=~\"$node\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#5794F2"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
